<LVClass LVVersion="20008000">
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.ContainingLib" Type="Str">ZM-HWM-hardware_manager.lvlib</Property>
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.ContainingLibPath" Type="Str">../../ZM-HWM-hardware_manager.lvlib</Property>
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">Hardware manager actor: owns a hardware object from its pre-launch settings. Its helper loop reads the hardware every intervalMs and sends each package to this actor, which counts it and forwards it to its caller. Error-handling plan: none yet; an error stops the actor, and its Last Ack stops the root and the tree.</Property>
